<title>USA: Allegro to change symbol in late Jan..</title>
<headline>Allegro to change symbol in late Jan..</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, N.J. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allegro New Media Inc said on Monday that its trading symbol will change to &quot;SPCO&quot; from &quot;SPCOD&quot;, effective January 28, 1997.</p>
<p>Allegro, a computer software maker, said it has increased the number of authorized common shares to 30 million from 18 million following its merger with Software Publishing.</p>
